ag in a public server ⚠️\n\n🏷️ Tags: Firework, Firecracker, Firework Simulator, Firework Playground, Firecracker simulator, Firecracker Playground, Fireworks, New Years, Explosive, Bomb, Simulator, Pyroworks","path":"/game/17783560582-pyro-playground","slug":"17783560582-pyro-playground","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/db9deeec341ee094f4754c51ef2f5babad92736653e262e9f27d730b7d8edead.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-df78fb532b9f93ddf1ec6f582404cd2f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":32,"visitor":33986768,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-20T07:55:12.110Z","creator":{"name":"Pyrotechnics Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":8,"freeCount":8,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":11109756592,"name":"YouTube Simulator Z","desc":"New WINTER UPDATE and 2x MONEY! \n\nYouTube Simulator Z is the THIRD GAME in the YouTube Simulator Series. Create videos, make thumbnails, and run your own channel... will you become the best YouTuber? \n\n💎 Premium benefits:\n- Teleporter\n- 2X Rubies \n- Exclusive house design \n\nIndieun ✍️\n\nTest","path":"/game/11109756592-youtube-simulator-z","slug":"11109756592-youtube-simulator-z","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/aa26ee3639b56471f77c1584bd2e5a2e630efa2121dcf3f2c88a98a93eec6ed5.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-33ce0f92fcd250e8c791df1b4cea52a5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":32,"visitor":148504694,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-09T03:27:36.212Z","creator":{"name":"indieuns","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":108354344401029,"name":"+1 Scream Per Click","desc":"📢 Welcome to +1 Scream Per Click!\n\n😱 Click to gain Scream and become louder!\n📣 Train in the training zones to increase your Scream\n🪟 Shout at glass to break it, earn Wins, and unlock new stages\n🏆 Compete and climb the leaderboard to become the loudest!\n\n👍 Like & ⭐ Favorite the game for future updates!\nThank you for playing!","path":"/game/108354344401029-1-scream-per-click","slug":"108354344401029-1-scream-per-click","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/4bb116e7bb278b79efe50abb9b0f9c4a9ed6bf817b3d86c880d1dba6a0b0cb9e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0e32a859c6f4303e704a1fd219db4265/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":32,"visitor":3055917,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-13T19:10:52.885Z","creator":{"name":"+1 Scream Per Click","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":730951264,"name":"The Maze","desc":"WARNING: FLASHING LIGHTS AND LOUD NOISES!\r\n\r\n------- SHORT ANNOUNCEMENT.\r\nAt the moment, this game is in a very early state, me and my small team have been working on a REBOOT for this game, planning out story elements, designs and ideas for the future of this project.\r\nDevelopment on The Maze Reboot has been a bit slow due to things like life but also because of my other projects which I will soon be finishing so I can dedicate myself to this game once again!\r\nHowever, I do want to announce that I plan to get a DEMO for The Maze Reboot out sometime in the future (also known as Update 4.5). Who knows how long it will take but thank you all for the support on this small project!\r\nThis is only the beginning!\r\n---------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nThis game was made for people looking for a scare. Perhaps people who like exploring. This is a very open game but once you get into the Maze, it gets very enclosed.","path":"/game/730951264-the-maze","slug":"730951264-the-maze","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/d448aa2be20845e879352c313ac26a14df48432863e94528a2101b3de4fc7938.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-214e74c267917ceaee4f0e3201ac6166/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":32,"visitor":259971605,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-04-13T20:03:32.392Z","creator":{"name":"HyperSlica","type":"User"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":990364410,"name":"Survive the Night","desc":"Welcome to Survive the Night! \n\n🏃 SURVIVAL MODE; run, hide, and do whatever you can to avoid dying!\n🔨 Equip gears and perks to increase your odds against the slashers and killers!\n🔦 Over 1000+ unique items to unlock and earn!\n🔪 Take control of the slasher and hunt down the survivors!\n\n🔫 HUNT MODE; work with your team to complete objectives and take down killers!\n🔧 Use your weapons and tools to customize your operatives play style!\n📌 Work with your team to complete various objectives and evac!\n\n📕 STORY MODE; immerse yourself in the story of Survive the Night!\n🔊 Voiced characters and mocapped cutscenes!\n🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Play with up to 4 people, or go in solo!\n\nThis game is a remake of the 2016 classic hide & seek game \"Before the Dawn\"\n\nCREDITS:\nMaximumADHD for the Realism library.\nhttps://devforum.roblox.com/t/realism-make-your-games-feel-more-immersive/898642\nSCP voice lines by TheVolgun.\nThe Rake sounds by RVVZ.","path":"/game/990364410-survive-the-night","slug":"990364410-survive-the-night","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/719d8714aa4cc2a208845fe12d4d4a8ca5a59efd5c92302d981397329ffea97a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-446ea6cd31173c5c521f621f8ae3db51/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":32,"visitor":116108449,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-19T15:37:02.192Z","creator":{"name":"Aurek Team","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}}],"totalGames":14119,"totalPages":589,"currentPage":208}